w('docs/index.md', "---\nlayout: home\nhero:\n  name: YL\n  text: Yankee Language\n  tagline: Esoteric language on PHP with unicode syntax. Unlike anything else.\n  actions:\n    - theme: brand\n      text: Getting started\n      link: /guide/getting-started\n    - theme: alt\n      text: Syntax\n      link: /guide/syntax\nfeatures:\n  - title: ~DECL~ ~FN~ ~LAM~ ~O~ ~C~\n    details: Unique symbols instead of keywords.\n  - title: OOP with ~INH~ inheritance\n    details: ~CLS~ Class ~INH~ Parent, ~MET~ method, ~NEW~ new.\n  - title: Closures and map/filter\n    details: ~LAM~ (x) ~O~ ^ x * 2 ~C~\n  - title: Generators on Fibers\n    details: ~YLD~ value + ~EACH~ x = gen ~O~ ~C~\n  - title: Async ~ASY~ ~AWT~\n    details: async fn and await built into the language.\n  - title: Stdlib + JSON + HTTP\n    details: prelude, math, list, string, json, datetime, http.\n---\n\n## Example\n\n```yl\n~CLS~ Animal ~O~\n    ~MET~ init(name :str) ~O~\n        this.name = name\n    ~C~\n    ~MET~ sound() ~O~\n        ^ \"...\"\n    ~C~\n~C~\n\n~CLS~ Dog ~INH~ Animal ~O~\n    ~MET~ sound() ~O~ ^ \"Woof!\" ~C~\n~C~\n\n~DECL~ rex = ~NEW~ Dog(\"Rex\")\n~PR~ rex.name + \" says: \" + rex.sound()\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```\nRex says: Woof!\n```\n");

w('docs/guide/getting-started.md', "# Getting started\n\n## Requirements\n\n- PHP 8.1+\n- Composer (optional)\n- Node 18+ (for building these docs)\n\n```bash\nphp -v\n```\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/your/yl.git\ncd yl\n```\n\n## First program\n\nCreate `hello.yl`:\n\n```yl\n~PR~ \"Hello, world!\"\n```\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nphp yl.php hello.yl\n```\n\n## Variables\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ name = \"Alice\"\n~DECL~ age = 25\n~DECL~ flag = ~T~\n```\n\n## Functions\n\n```yl\n~FN~ square(x) ~O~\n    ^ x * x\n~C~\n```\n\n## REPL\n\n```bash\nphp yl.php --repl\n```\n\nCommands: `:help`, `:vars`, `:load <file>`, `exit`.\n\n## Playground\n\n```bash\ncd playground\nphp -S 127.0.0.1:8080\n```\n\n## Compiler\n\n```bash\nphp ylc.php script.yl script.php\nphp script.php\n```\n");

w('docs/guide/syntax.md', "# Syntax\n\n## Symbols\n\n| Symbol | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `~` | comment |\n| `~DECL~` | declare variable |\n| `~FN~` | function |\n| `~LAM~` | lambda |\n| `~PR~` | print |\n| `~O~ ~C~` | block |\n| `?` / `~EL~` | if / else |\n| `@` | while |\n| `#` | for |\n| `~EACH~` | foreach |\n| `^` | return |\n| `~YLD~` | yield |\n| `~TRY~ ~CTH~ ~FIN~` | try/catch/finally |\n| `~IMP~` | import |\n| `~BRK~ ~CNT~` | break/continue |\n| `~AST~` | assert |\n| `~T~ ~F~ ~NUL~` | true/false/null |\n| `~DO~ ~DC~` | dict |\n| `~CLS~` | class |\n| `~MET~` | method |\n| `~NEW~` | new |\n| `~INH~` | inherit |\n| `~ASY~ ~AWT~` | async/await |\n\n## Variables\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ x = 5\n~DECL~ name = \"Alice\"\n~DECL~ flag = ~T~\n~DECL~ nums = [1, 2, 3]\n~DECL~ person = ~DO~\"name\": \"Alice\", \"age\": 25~DC~\n```\n\nWith types:\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ x :int = 5\n~DECL~ name :str = \"Alice\"\n```\n\n## Conditionals\n\n```yl\n? x > 5 ~O~\n    ~PR~ \"greater than 5\"\n~C~ ~EL~ ~O~\n    ~PR~ \"not greater\"\n~C~\n```\n\n## Loops\n\n```yl\n@ i < 10 ~O~\n    ~PR~ i\n    i = i + 1\n~C~\n\n# i = 0 .. 10 ~O~\n    ~PR~ i\n~C~\n\n~EACH~ x = [1, 2, 3] ~O~\n    ~PR~ x\n~C~\n```\n\n## Functions\n\n```yl\n~FN~ add(a, b) ~O~\n    ^ a + b\n~C~\n\n~FN~ sqrt_newton(x :float) :float ~O~\n    ? x <= 0 ~O~ ^ 0 ~C~\n    ~DECL~ g = x / 2\n    # i = 0 .. 10 ~O~\n        g = (g + x / g) / 2\n    ~C~\n    ^ g\n~C~\n```\n\n## Closures\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ double = ~LAM~ (x) ~O~ ^ x * 2 ~C~\n~PR~ double(21)\n```\n\n## Destructuring\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ [a, b, c] = [1, 2, 3]\n~DECL~ ~DO~\"x\", \"y\"~DC~ = ~DO~\"x\": 10, \"y\": 20~DC~\n```\n\n## Classes\n\n```yl\n~CLS~ Animal ~O~\n    ~MET~ init(name :str) ~O~\n        this.name = name\n    ~C~\n    ~MET~ sound() ~O~\n        ^ \"...\"\n    ~C~\n~C~\n\n~CLS~ Dog ~INH~ Animal ~O~\n    ~MET~ sound() ~O~ ^ \"Woof!\" ~C~\n~C~\n\n~DECL~ rex = ~NEW~ Dog(\"Rex\")\n~PR~ rex.name + \" says: \" + rex.sound()\n```\n\n## Generators\n\n```yl\n~FN~ evens(n) ~O~\n    # i = 0 .. n ~O~\n        ? even(i) ~O~ ~YLD~ i ~C~\n    ~C~\n~C~\n\n~EACH~ x = evens(10) ~O~\n    ~PR~ \"even:\", x\n~C~\n```\n\nGenerators use real PHP Fibers.\n\n## Async\n\n```yl\n~ASY~ ~FN~ slow(x) ~O~\n    ^ x * 2\n~C~\n\n~DECL~ t = slow(21)\n~PR~ ~AWT~ t\n```\n\n## Error handling\n\n```yl\n~TRY~ ~O~\n    ~DECL~ r = 10 / 0\n~C~ ~CTH~ e ~O~\n    ~PR~ \"Caught:\", e\n~C~ ~FIN~ ~O~\n    ~PR~ \"finally\"\n~C~\n```\n\n## Modules\n\n```yl\n~IMP~ \"std/math.yl\" as m\n~PR~ m.square(6)\n```\n");

w('docs/guide/stdlib.md', "# Standard library\n\n## Auto-loaded: std/prelude.yl\n\n### Strings\n\n`position`, `contains`, `repeat`, `replace`\n\n### Arrays\n\n`sum`, `product`, `average`, `sort`, `unique`, `max_of`, `min_of`\n\n### Math\n\n`factorial`, `gcd`, `even`, `odd`\n\n## Built-ins\n\n### General\n\n`len`, `str`, `num`, `type`, `assert`, `eval`, `exit`, `dump`, `time`\n\n### Strings\n\n`upper`, `lower`, `trim`, `split`, `join`\n\n### Math\n\n`abs`, `floor`, `ceil`, `round`, `min`, `max`, `sqrt`, `rand`, `range`\n\n### Arrays\n\n`push`, `pop`, `keys`, `vals`, `map`, `filter`, `reduce`\n\n### JSON\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ data = json_parse('{\"x\": 1}')\n~PR~ data[\"x\"]\n~DECL~ s = json_str(data)\n~DECL~ pretty = json_str_pretty(data)\n```\n\n### Date / time\n\n```yl\n~PR~ now()\n~PR~ today()\n~PR~ ISO(now())\n```\n\n### HTTP\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ html = http_get(\"https://example.com\")\n~DECL~ resp = http_post(\"https://api.example.com\", \"{}\")\n```\n\n### Files\n\n`readfile`, `writefile`, `appendfile`, `exists`, `read`\n\n## Extra modules\n\n### std/math.yl\n\n```yl\n~IMP~ \"std/math.yl\" as m\n~PR~ m.PI\n~PR~ m.power(2, 10)\n~PR~ m.clamp(15, 0, 10)\n```\n\n### std/list.yl\n\n```yl\n~IMP~ \"std/list.yl\" as list\n~PR~ list.head([1,2,3])\n~PR~ list.reverse([1,2,3])\n```\n\n### std/string.yl\n\n```yl\n~IMP~ \"std/string.yl\" as s\n~PR~ s.capital(\"hello\")\n~PR~ s.words(\"a b c\")\n```\n\n### std/json.yl\n\n```yl\n~IMP~ \"std/json.yl\" as j\n~PR~ j.parse('{\"x\":1}')\n~PR~ j.encode([1,2,3])\n```\n\n### std/datetime.yl\n\n```yl\n~IMP~ \"std/datetime.yl\" as dt\n~PR~ dt.now_str()\n~PR~ dt.ISO(now())\n```\n");

