w('docs/en/guide/syntax.md', "# Syntax\n\n## Symbols\n\n| Symbol | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `~DECL~` | declare |\n| `~FN~` | function |\n| `~LAM~` | lambda |\n| `~PR~` | print |\n| `~O~ ~C~` | block |\n| `?` / `~EL~` | if / else |\n| `@` | while |\n| `#` | for |\n| `~EACH~` | foreach |\n| `^` | return |\n| `~YLD~` | yield |\n| `~TRY~ ~CTH~ ~FIN~` | try/catch/finally |\n| `~IMP~` | import |\n| `~BRK~ ~CNT~` | break/continue |\n| `~T~ ~F~ ~NUL~` | true/false/null |\n| `~CLS~ ~MET~ ~NEW~ ~INH~` | class machinery |\n| `~ASY~ ~AWT~` | async/await |\n\n## Variables\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ x = 5\n~DECL~ name = \"Alice\"\n~DECL~ nums = [1, 2, 3]\n~DECL~ person = ~DO~\"name\": \"Alice\"~DC~\n```\n\nWith types: `~DECL~ x :int = 5`.\n\n## Conditionals\n\n```yl\n? x > 5 ~O~\n    ~PR~ \"big\"\n~C~ ~EL~ ~O~\n    ~PR~ \"small\"\n~C~\n```\n\n## Loops\n\n```yl\n@ i < 10 ~O~ i = i + 1 ~C~\n# i = 0 .. 10 ~O~ ~PR~ i ~C~\n~EACH~ x = [1, 2, 3] ~O~ ~PR~ x ~C~\n```\n\n## Functions and closures\n\n```yl\n~FN~ add(a, b) ~O~ ^ a + b ~C~\n~DECL~ double = ~LAM~ (x) ~O~ ^ x * 2 ~C~\n```\n\n## Classes\n\n```yl\n~CLS~ Dog ~O~\n    ~MET~ init(name) ~O~ this.name = name ~C~\n    ~MET~ sound() ~O~ ^ \"Woof!\" ~C~\n~C~\n\n~DECL~ rex = ~NEW~ Dog(\"Rex\")\n```\n\n## Generators / Async\n\n```yl\n~FN~ evens(n) ~O~ # i = 0 .. n ~O~ ? even(i) ~O~ ~YLD~ i ~C~ ~C~ ~C~\n\n~ASY~ ~FN~ slow(x) ~O~ ^ x * 2 ~C~\n~DECL~ t = slow(21)\n~PR~ ~AWT~ t\n```\n\n## Error handling\n\n```yl\n~TRY~ ~O~ ~DECL~ r = 10 / 0 ~C~ ~CTH~ e ~O~ ~PR~ e ~C~ ~FIN~ ~O~ ~PR~ \"done\" ~C~\n```\n");

w('docs/en/guide/stdlib.md', "# Standard library\n\n## Auto-loaded prelude\n\nStrings: `position`, `contains`, `repeat`, `replace`.\nArrays: `sum`, `product`, `average`, `sort`, `unique`, `max_of`, `min_of`.\nMath: `factorial`, `gcd`, `even`, `odd`.\n\n## Built-ins\n\nGeneral: `len`, `str`, `num`, `type`, `assert`, `eval`, `exit`, `dump`, `time`.\nStrings: `upper`, `lower`, `trim`, `split`, `join`.\nMath: `abs`, `floor`, `ceil`, `round`, `min`, `max`, `sqrt`, `rand`, `range`.\nArrays: `push`, `pop`, `keys`, `vals`, `map`, `filter`, `reduce`.\n\n## JSON\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ data = json_parse('{\"x\": 1}')\n~PR~ data[\"x\"]\n```\n\n## Datetime\n\n```yl\n~PR~ now()\n~PR~ ISO(now())\n```\n\n## HTTP\n\n```yl\n~DECL~ html = http_get(\"https://example.com\")\n```\n\n## Files\n\n`readfile`, `writefile`, `appendfile`, `exists`, `read`.\n\n## Extra modules\n\n```yl\n~IMP~ \"std/math.yl\" as m\n~IMP~ \"std/list.yl\" as list\n~IMP~ \"std/json.yl\" as j\n~IMP~ \"std/datetime.yl\" as dt\n```\n");

